{"seq":14,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/qm-pi-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:32:53.726Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"f141a5ec44e9b01fb2a2940c3092be53475cc5b7411663732d95e74ecca3298b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"north-team","text":"@Ilse Varga The main contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She's the one who flagged the duplicate arrivals on door 6 during the morning shift, as Dana posted here on 8/20/2025. Dana Okafor is handling it on our side.","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000129","thread_ts":"1791987000.000128"}}
{"seq":15,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/qm-pi-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/si-04-quarrendon-main-contact/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:32:58.868Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"d57225f4f770c8ebc05e20389d9ff56bd710d0753df15164c1f4b52169dba915","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I replied to Ilse in a thread in #north-team: the main contact is **Thea Ramaswell**, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines.\n\n- **Where it comes from:** On 8/20/2025, Dana Okafor posted in #north-team that Thea had flagged the duplicate arrivals on door 6 again on the morning shift. The North cheat sheet also lists Thea as the account's main contact.\n- **Who's on it:** Dana said she was looking into the issue separately. The cause was the same trailer checking in twice: the driver checked in at the kiosk, then dispatch added him by hand.\n- **Easy to mix up:** Thea's ticket #4419 is a different problem, about barcode scanners at Door 14. Quarendon Freightways is also a different company and isn't one of our customers."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791987000.000130"}}
